      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "content": "Select a service above to focus the dashboard. Heap, process CPU, uptime, threads, GC, request rate, and p95 latency come from Spring Actuator metrics. HTTP latency uses histogram buckets, which appear after services restart with the updated configuration. Exemplar links require a request trace and Prometheus exemplar storage. Process open-file metrics are not exposed by the current Windows-hosted services.",
